      text:"In modern corporate environments, employees must learn to act professionally under stress. When unexpected problems arise, successful managers react calmly and analyze the situation carefully. They do not speak hastily or make reckless decisions. Instead, they listen attentively to their team members and assign tasks fairly. Employees who communicate clearly and work hard usually resolve issues easily. Even when deadlines approach fast, a well-organized team functions smoothly and produces excellent results.",
